      "id": "claim_0e227b88b5d94fd5924bb5c89a53831e",
      "statement": "Open SWE's backend is a LangGraph application that serves multiple graphs (agent, reviewer, analyzer, chat, scheduler) together with a FastAPI app (agent.webapp:app), all wired through langgraph.json which also declares the checkpointer TTL policy and .env env file.",
